{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orthodox Mystery x Horror Puzzle Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work focuses on the bond between a pair of siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the protagonist, <strong>Shinonome Yuki</strong>, and together with his sister, <strong>Shinonome Akari</strong>, they use deduction to uncover the truth behind murder cases occurring around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/3e34905d9e5978ff7b98de2b81d948ed.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay consists of Investigation Parts and Deduction Parts. During the Investigation Part, you solve mysteries at the crime scene while gathering evidence. Once all evidence is collected, you enter the Deduction Part to expose the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/9a983ed3f98d641783aa3675557b706b.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title focuses on identifying the culprit and unraveling the murder method, offering a story where you can savor the essence of a true orthodox mystery. Before the solution is revealed, a &quot;Challenge to Players&quot; is presented, so those confident in their reasoning skills may attempt to uncover the truth on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/60f35aa9583fd839154efce24fe86522.avif?t=1774449168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras_big/60f35aa9583fd839154efce24fe86522.webp?t=1774449168 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rich Expression Through Detailed Pixel Art and Manga-Style Illustrations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From recreating the events of the case and the truth to investigating minute items, intricate pixel art and manga-style illustrations are provided, allowing you to thoroughly examine every corner of the game's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/d83b0d427abc223178eb33e3e0d8012a.avif?t=1774449168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras_big/d83b0d427abc223178eb33e3e0d8012a.avif?t=1774449168 width=1600 height=898 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Story </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the world seems peaceful at first glance, it hides many dangers, and sudden death can strike at any time, requiring utmost caution during exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/f3ba9fd74d749530e9e2fe205b89ba68.avif?t=1774449168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras_big/f3ba9fd74d749530e9e2fe205b89ba68.avif?t=1774449168 width=1600 height=902 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/679aca0ec12eae91bbd6e4aa3700c1ad.avif?t=1774449168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras_big/679aca0ec12eae91bbd6e4aa3700c1ad.avif?t=1774449168 width=1600 height=902 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/9a9fd0a835e683745f172379642f8ca4.poster.avif?t=1774449168\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/9a9fd0a835e683745f172379642f8ca4.webm?t=1774449168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/9a9fd0a835e683745f172379642f8ca4.mp4?t=1774449168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, while being an orthodox mystery, it incorporates supernatural and sci-fi elements, allowing you to experience a unique worldview where warmth and cruelty blend together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/5860ba2ad95479692d498a71e516e5a8.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/32ae2050732d70ef6a21df298c4ed5f5.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shinonome Yuki</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist. 10 years old. Possesses maturity beyond his years and can think calmly in the face of events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves his sister dearly, but becomes particularly shy only in her presence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently striving to become a famous detective's assistant.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/43513d4b4726f3385fda23e22ee9cfb3.avif?t=1774449168\" width=713 height=720 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shinonome Akari</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's sister. 17 years old. A third-year high school student attending the city's most prestigious private girls' school.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent but physically very frail, so she rarely goes out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loves mystery novels and dreamed of becoming a detective as a child.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/6668500c1181f983fc8ce49623d1c6ab.avif?t=1774449168\" width=655 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Chapters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative spans nine years, divided into the <strong>Past Arc</strong> and the <strong>Main Arc</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Past Arc</strong> tells the story of the protagonist's childhood and consists of one chapter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Main Arc's</strong> story unfolds primarily nine years later and consists of four chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is an independent, self-contained deduction story, while an overarching main storyline threads through all of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Generative AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art and music assets are created by artists/musicians. No generative AI was used.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X: hamstachio</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord Server: hamstachio</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915360?t=1774449168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/f919cfbb5427918a007e43373c47151f73ee8838/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774449168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/f68bc23d0239a07f13ff01daec2cab85533e3a87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774449168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/f68bc23d0239a07f13ff01daec2cab85533e3a87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774449168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orthodox Mystery x Horror Puzzle Solving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work focuses on the bond between a pair of siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of the protagonist, <strong>Shinonome Yuki</strong>, and together with his sister, <strong>Shinonome Akari</strong>, they use deduction to uncover the truth behind murder cases occurring around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/3e34905d9e5978ff7b98de2b81d948ed.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay consists of Investigation Parts and Deduction Parts. During the Investigation Part, you solve mysteries at the crime scene while gathering evidence. Once all evidence is collected, you enter the Deduction Part to expose the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915360/extras/9a983ed3f98d641783aa3675557b706b.avif?t=1774449168\" width=1600 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title focuses on identifying the culprit and unraveling the murder method, offering a story where you can savor the essence of a true orthodox mystery. Before the solution is revealed, a &quot;Challenge to Players&quot; is presen